    "details": "<div class=\"relative basis-auto flex-col -mb-(--composer-overlap-px) pb-(--composer-overlap-px) [--composer-overlap-px:28px] grow flex\">\n<div class=\"flex min-h-0 grow flex-col text-sm\">\n<div class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\">\n<div class=\"\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-6aab9d90-d398-83ee-99bb-ad19ed4ed742-7\" data-is-intersecting=\"true\">\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-6aab9d90-d398-83ee-99bb-ad19ed4ed742-7\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-6aab9d90-d398-83ee-99bb-ad19ed4ed742-7\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-16\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-8 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\">\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"7b77ce51-ef00-444b-85e7-4cdd9df129b6\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-6\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\n<div class=\"LR5Y_W_content markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling\">\n<h1 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"egnjf5\" data-start=\"79\" data-end=\"104\">GENESIS &ndash; The Hackathon</h1>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"14y484q\" data-start=\"106\" data-end=\"154\">IMPORTANT: EXTERNAL REGISTRATION REQUIRED</h3>\n<p class=\"\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"155\" data-end=\"295\">Participants <strong data-start=\"168\" data-end=\"230\">must complete registration on the official GENESIS website</strong>. Registering on Unstop alone does <strong data-start=\"265\" data-end=\"272\">not</strong> confirm participation.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"297\" data-end=\"356\"><strong data-start=\"300\" data-end=\"318\">Register here:</strong> <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"317\" data-content-reference-end=\"402\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https://saintjspmrscoe.web.app/events/SK9KyWhskjw7mTbySghQ?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GENESIS Registration</a></span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"440\"><strong data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"440\">Unstop will be used for the assessment, round-wise communication, and results.</strong></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"1ma5lrf\" data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"459\">About GENESIS</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"681\"><strong data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"487\">GENESIS &ndash; The Hackathon</strong> is a state-level, team-based technical hackathon organized by the <strong data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"657\">Department of Information Technology, JSPM&rsquo;s Rajarshi Shahu College of Engineering, Tathawade, Pune</strong>, under <strong data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"680\">IMPACT 2026</strong>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"806\">Participants will tackle technical and real-world challenges through <strong data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"805\">problem-solving, coding, innovation, and teamwork</strong>.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"1oaxnt6\" data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"841\">Eligibility &amp; Team Details</h3>\n<ul data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"1031\">\n<li data-section-id=\"9wvyqg\" data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"869\">Open to college students.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"14x4q7v\" data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"898\"><strong data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"886\">Team Size:</strong> 4&ndash;5 members</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"q6g63q\" data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"933\"><strong data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"925\">Inter-college teams:</strong> Allowed</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1whjbax\" data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"982\"><strong data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"974\">Inter-specialization/branch teams:</strong> Allowed</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1srbtri\" data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1031\">Each participant can be part of only one team.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"evz0p6\" data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1058\">Competition Format</h3>\n<p class=\"\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1266\"><strong data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1091\">Round 1 &ndash; Online Assessment</strong><br data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1094\" />An online assessment to evaluate participants' <strong data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1210\">technical knowledge, logical thinking, and problem-solving skills</strong>. Shortlisted teams will qualify for the offline rounds.</p>\n<p class=\"\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1430\"><strong data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1297\">Round 2 &ndash; Offline Round 1</strong><br data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1300\" />A team-based technical challenge conducted at <strong data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1379\">JSPM&rsquo;s RSCOE, Tathawade, Pune</strong>, focusing on problem-solving and technical skills.</p>\n<p class=\"\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1631\"><strong data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1465\">Round 3 &ndash; Offline Final Round</strong><br data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1468\" />Finalist teams will compete in an on-campus challenge requiring them to apply their <strong data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1601\">technical knowledge, creativity, and teamwork</strong> to solve the given challenge.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1633\" data-end=\"1761\">Detailed instructions, timings, and requirements for each round will be communicated through Unstop and official event channels.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"1317kq5\" data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1775\">Rules</h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"2238\">\n<li data-section-id=\"p8ggw7\" data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1817\">External registration is <strong data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1816\">mandatory</strong>.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"12sy08g\" data-start=\"1818\" data-end=\"1858\">Teams must consist of <strong data-start=\"1842\" data-end=\"1857\">4&ndash;5 members</strong>.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"juyi89\" data-start=\"1859\" data-end=\"1918\">Inter-college and inter-specialization teams are allowed.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"4rmv9u\" data-start=\"1919\" data-end=\"1963\">Participants can be part of only one team.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1rsvctb\" data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"2027\">All submissions must be completed within the given deadlines.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"10ovyi8\" data-start=\"2028\" data-end=\"2109\">Plagiarism, impersonation, or unfair practices will result in disqualification.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"dt3yox\" data-start=\"2110\" data-end=\"2169\">Participants must follow all round-specific instructions.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1p5rh8o\" data-start=\"2170\" data-end=\"2238\">The decision of the judges and organizing committee will be final.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"1h9tyat\" data-start=\"2240\" data-end=\"2254\">Contact</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2359\"><strong data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2273\">Vansh Bipalliwar:</strong> 8767559421<br data-start=\"2284\" data-end=\"2287\" /><strong data-start=\"2287\" data-end=\"2308\">Prachi Janwadkar:</strong> 8830639961<br data-start=\"2319\" data-end=\"2322\" /><strong data-start=\"2322\" data-end=\"2332\">Email:</strong> <a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"mailto:impact_it@jspmrscoe.edu.in\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2333\" data-end=\"2359\">impact_it@jspmrscoe.edu.in</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2361\" data-end=\"2412\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2361\" data-end=\"2412\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Build. Innovate. Collaborate. Forge the Future.</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none -mb-px h-px w-full opacity-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden has-[&gt;_:empty]:hidden\">\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1\" data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\">\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"invisible mt-auto grid\">\n<div class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1\">\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none translate-y-(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom) R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars min-h-(--gutter-remaining-height,0px) group-data-stream-active/scroll-root:h-[calc(var(--thread-response-height)-16*var(--spacing))]\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"visible sticky bottom-(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px) col-start-1 row-start-1 self-end\">\n<div class=\"\" data-testid=\"thread-disclaimer\">\n<div class=\"min-h